# Copy to `.env` and fill in to turn on Cloudflare Web Analytics.
#
# The token comes from Cloudflare's dashboard: Analytics & Logs -> Web
# Analytics -> Add a site, then copy the `token` out of the snippet it shows.
# Leave it unset and the build ships no beacon at all, so a fork does not report
# its visitors to this deployment's account. It is only emitted in a production
# build, so `astro dev` never sends anything either.
#
# PUBLIC_CF_BEACON_TOKEN=
